{%- comment -%}
  A code block for the chrome (Starlight's <Code> in the install CLI modal): a fence as the `markdown` step writes
  them, with frame=none, which the `highlight-chrome` step renders in Expressive Code's markup once the `layout` step
  wrote the chrome (the `highlight` step runs before it).
  Include arguments: cp_code (text), cp_lang.
{%- endcomment -%}
<pre data-lang="{{ cp_lang }}" data-meta="frame=none"><code>{{ cp_code }}</code></pre>
